      subscriptions.
   c. Charge for installing, setting up, supporting or hosting the Software
      for others.
   d. Include the Software, or any part of it, in a product or service that
      you sell or charge for.
   e. Remove or change this license or the copyright notices.

   Using the Software inside your own clinic or business is allowed, even
   though your clinic or business earns money. What is not allowed is
   earning money from the Software itself.


3. SHARING CHANGED VERSIONS

   If you share a changed version of the Software, you must:

   a. share it free of charge, under this same license;
